<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Nyrah Beauty — AM/PM Routine Guide</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,600;1,300;1,400&family=Jost:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  :root {
    --gold-deep: #8B6914;
    --gold-mid: #C49A2A;
    --gold-light: #E8C96A;
    --gold-pale: #F7EDD0;
    --gold-faint: #FDF8EE;
    --cream: #FFFDF6;
    --charcoal: #1C1810;
    --warm-dark: #2D2416;
    --warm-mid: #6B5A3A;
    --warm-light: #A89070;
    --warm-faint: #EDE5D4;
    --white: #FFFFFF;
    --am-primary: #8B6914;
    --am-accent: #F0B429;
    --pm-primary: #2D3A5A;
    --pm-accent: #7B9EC8;
    --pm-pale: #EEF2F9;
    --step-radius: 14px;
    --card-radius: 20px;
  }

  body {
    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
    background: var(--cream);
    color: var(--charcoal);
    min-height: 100vh;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* HERO */
  .hero {
    background: var(--warm-dark);
    padding: 60px 40px 50px;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -60px; left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 500px; height: 500px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid rgba(196,154,42,0.15);
  }
  .hero::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -30px; left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 300px; height: 300px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid rgba(196,154,42,0.1);
  }
  .hero-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold-light);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px);
    color: var(--gold-pale);
    line-height: 1.15;
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .hero h1 em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--gold-light);
  }
  .hero-sub {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--warm-light);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  /* TAB SWITCHER */
  .tab-bar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .tab-btn {
    padding: 12px 40px;
    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    border: 1px solid rgba(196,154,42,0.3);
    background: transparent;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    color: var(--warm-light);
  }
  .tab-btn:first-child { border-radius: 40px 0 0 40px; border-right: none; }
  .tab-btn:last-child { border-radius: 0 40px 40px 0; }
  .tab-btn.active-am {
    background: var(--gold-mid);
    border-color: var(--gold-mid);
    color: var(--warm-dark);
  }
  .tab-btn.active-pm {
    background: var(--pm-primary);
    border-color: var(--pm-primary);
    color: var(--gold-pale);
  }

  /* MAIN LAYOUT */
  .main {
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 50px 24px 80px;
  }

  /* ROUTINE PANELS */
  .routine-panel { display: none; }
  .routine-panel.active { display: block; }

  /* SECTION HEADER */
  .section-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .time-badge {
    width: 64px; height: 64px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .time-badge.am { background: var(--gold-pale); border: 1px solid var(--gold-light); }
  .time-badge.pm { background: var(--pm-pale); border: 1px solid var(--pm-accent); }
  .time-badge svg { width: 28px; height: 28px; }
  .section-title h2 {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 28px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--charcoal);
  }
  .section-title p {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--warm-mid);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  /* STEPS */
  .steps-flow {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
  }
  .step-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0;
    position: relative;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  /* Connector line */
  .step-connector {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 52px;
  }
  .step-num {
    width: 36px; height: 36px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .am .step-num { background: var(--gold-pale); color: var(--gold-deep); border: 1.5px solid var(--gold-light); }
  .am .step-item:hover .step-num,
  .am .step-item.open .step-num { background: var(--gold-mid); color: var(--white); border-color: var(--gold-mid); }
  .pm .step-num { background: var(--pm-pale); color: var(--pm-primary); border: 1.5px solid var(--pm-accent); }
  .pm .step-item:hover .step-num,
  .pm .step-item.open .step-num { background: var(--pm-primary); color: var(--white); border-color: var(--pm-primary); }

  .connector-line {
    width: 1px;
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 20px;
  }
  .am .connector-line { background: var(--gold-pale); }
  .pm .connector-line { background: var(--pm-pale); }
  .step-item:last-child .connector-line { display: none; }

  /* Step card */
  .step-card {
    flex: 1;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    margin-left: 12px;
    border-radius: var(--card-radius);
    border: 1px solid var(--warm-faint);
    background: var(--white);
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }
  .am .step-item:hover .step-card,
  .am .step-item.open .step-card {
    border-color: var(--gold-light);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(139,105,20,0.08);
  }
  .pm .step-item:hover .step-card,
  .pm .step-item.open .step-card {
    border-color: var(--pm-accent);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(45,58,90,0.08);
  }

  .step-card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 18px 20px;
  }
  .step-card-left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; }
  .step-tag {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 20px;
  }
  .am .step-tag { background: var(--gold-faint); color: var(--gold-deep); }
  .pm .step-tag { background: var(--pm-pale); color: var(--pm-primary); }

  .step-name {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--charcoal);
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .step-subtitle {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--warm-mid);
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .chevron {
    width: 18px; height: 18px;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .step-item.open .chevron { transform: rotate(180deg); }

  /* Expanded content */
  .step-expanded {
    max-height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: max-height 0.4s ease;
  }
  .step-item.open .step-expanded { max-height: 600px; }

  .step-expanded-inner {
    padding: 0 20px 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--warm-faint);
    padding-top: 18px;
  }

  .expand-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .expand-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .expand-box {
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
  }
  .expand-box.role { background: var(--gold-faint); }
  .pm .expand-box.role { background: var(--pm-pale); }
  .expand-box.why { background: var(--warm-faint); }
  .expand-box-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .am .expand-box.role .expand-box-label { color: var(--gold-deep); }
  .pm .expand-box.role .expand-box-label { color: var(--pm-primary); }
  .expand-box.why .expand-box-label { color: var(--warm-mid); }
  .expand-box p {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--warm-dark);
  }

  .ingredients-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .ingredient-pill {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 400;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    border: 1px solid;
  }
  .am .ingredient-pill { border-color: var(--gold-light); color: var(--gold-deep); background: var(--gold-faint); }
  .pm .ingredient-pill { border-color: var(--pm-accent); color: var(--pm-primary); background: var(--pm-pale); }

  .analogy-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--warm-faint);
  }
  .analogy-icon {
    font-size: 16px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .analogy-text {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--warm-mid);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* SUMMARY BOX */
  .summary-bar {
    margin-top: 40px;
    border-radius: var(--card-radius);
    padding: 28px 32px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .am .summary-bar { background: var(--gold-pale); border: 1px solid var(--gold-light); }
  .pm .summary-bar { background: var(--pm-pale); border: 1px solid var(--pm-accent); }
  .summary-icon { font-size: 24px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .summary-text { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 17px; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.6; }
  .am .summary-text { color: var(--gold-deep); }
  .pm .summary-text { color: var(--pm-primary); }

  /* PRO TIP */
  .pro-tip {
    margin-top: 16px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    background: var(--warm-faint);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--gold-mid);
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .pro-tip-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold-deep);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    padding-top: 2px;
  }
  .pro-tip p { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 300; color: var(--warm-dark); line-height: 1.6; }

  /* FOOTER NOTE */
  .footer-note {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 60px;
    padding-top: 40px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--warm-faint);
  }
  .footer-note p {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--warm-light);
  }
  .footer-note strong {
    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    display: block;
    margin-top: 8px;
    color: var(--gold-mid);
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-eyebrow">Nyrah Beauty · Skincare Guide</div>
  <h1>Your Skin.<br><em>Morning & Night.</em></h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">Understand every step — what it does, why it matters, and how it works.</p>
  <div class="tab-bar">
    <button class="tab-btn active-am" onclick="switchTab('am')">&#9788; Morning Routine</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('pm')">&#9790; Evening Routine</button>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="main">

  <!-- AM PANEL -->
  <div class="routine-panel active am" id="panel-am">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="time-badge am">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none">
          <circle cx="14" cy="14" r="5" fill="#C49A2A"/>
          <line x1="14" y1="2" x2="14" y2="5" stroke="#C49A2A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <line x1="14" y1="23" x2="14" y2="26" stroke="#C49A2A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <line x1="2" y1="14" x2="5" y2="14" stroke="#C49A2A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <line x1="23" y1="14" x2="26" y2="14" stroke="#C49A2A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <line x1="5.5" y1="5.5" x2="7.5" y2="7.5" stroke="#C49A2A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <line x1="20.5" y1="20.5" x2="22.5" y2="22.5" stroke="#C49A2A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <line x1="22.5" y1="5.5" x2="20.5" y2="7.5" stroke="#C49A2A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <line x1="7.5" y1="20.5" x2="5.5" y2="22.5" stroke="#C49A2A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="section-title">
        <h2>Morning Routine</h2>
        <p>5 steps · Clean, hydrate, nourish, protect, set</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="steps-flow">

      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="step-item" onclick="toggleStep(this)">
        <div class="step-connector">
          <div class="step-num">1</div>
          <div class="connector-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-card-header">
            <div class="step-card-left">
              <div>
                <div class="step-name">Undress</div>
                <div class="step-subtitle">Vitamin E+C Gel Cleanser · Wash off</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;">
              <span class="step-tag">Clean</span>
              <svg class="chevron" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><path d="M4 6.5L9 11.5L14 6.5" stroke="#A89070" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="step-expanded">
            <div class="step-expanded-inner">
              <div class="expand-grid">
                <div class="expand-box role">
                  <div class="expand-box-label">What it does</div>
                  <p>Removes overnight sweat, oil, and product residue. Gives you a clean surface so every product after it can actually absorb.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="expand-box why">
                  <div class="expand-box-label">Why first</div>
                  <p>Nothing works properly on dirty skin. If you skip this, the serums that follow sit on top of oil and dead cells instead of your actual skin.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="ingredients-row">
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Vitamin E</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Vitamin C</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Avocado Oil</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Sunflower Oil</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Papaya Extract</span>
              </div>
              <div class="analogy-bar">
                <span class="analogy-icon">🧱</span>
                <span class="analogy-text">Think of it as cleaning the wall before you paint. Everything else depends on this step being done right.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="step-item" onclick="toggleStep(this)">
        <div class="step-connector">
          <div class="step-num">2</div>
          <div class="connector-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-card-header">
            <div class="step-card-left">
              <div>
                <div class="step-name">Drench</div>
                <div class="step-subtitle">Triple Molecular Hyaluronic Serum · Apply to damp skin</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;">
              <span class="step-tag">Hydrate</span>
              <svg class="chevron" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><path d="M4 6.5L9 11.5L14 6.5" stroke="#A89070" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="step-expanded">
            <div class="step-expanded-inner">
              <div class="expand-grid">
                <div class="expand-box role">
                  <div class="expand-box-label">What it does</div>
                  <p>Hyaluronic acid draws water into the deeper layers of skin and holds it there. Applied while skin is slightly damp to pull in maximum moisture.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="expand-box why">
                  <div class="expand-box-label">Why second</div>
                  <p>Lightest product goes on first. Hyaluronic acid is almost watery — it must go on before anything heavier or it can't reach the skin properly.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="ingredients-row">
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Glycerin</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Acacia Gum</span>
              </div>
              <div class="analogy-bar">
                <span class="analogy-icon">💧</span>
                <span class="analogy-text">Like watering a plant before fertilising it. The moisture sets up the skin to absorb everything that follows.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="step-item" onclick="toggleStep(this)">
        <div class="step-connector">
          <div class="step-num">3</div>
          <div class="connector-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-card-header">
            <div class="step-card-left">
              <div>
                <div class="step-name">Glisten</div>
                <div class="step-subtitle">Seaweed &amp; Avocado Peptide Serum</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;">
              <span class="step-tag">Nourish</span>
              <svg class="chevron" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><path d="M4 6.5L9 11.5L14 6.5" stroke="#A89070" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="step-expanded">
            <div class="step-expanded-inner">
              <div class="expand-grid">
                <div class="expand-box role">
                  <div class="expand-box-label">What it does</div>
                  <p>Peptides signal the skin to produce more collagen and repair itself. Seaweed and avocado extracts act as antioxidants — protecting skin from pollution and environmental damage during the day.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="expand-box why">
                  <div class="expand-box-label">Why third</div>
                  <p>Goes on after Drench while skin is still receptive. Thicker than Drench but lighter than moisturiser — correct layering order ensures proper absorption.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="ingredients-row">
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Peptides</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Brown Algae</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Avocado Extract</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Aloe Vera</span>
              </div>
              <div class="analogy-bar">
                <span class="analogy-icon">🌿</span>
                <span class="analogy-text">Think of it as the nutrition layer — feeding the skin while also putting up a shield against the day ahead.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 4 -->
      <div class="step-item" onclick="toggleStep(this)">
        <div class="step-connector">
          <div class="step-num">4</div>
          <div class="connector-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-card-header">
            <div class="step-card-left">
              <div>
                <div class="step-name">Infuse</div>
                <div class="step-subtitle">Oxygen Botanical Moisturiser · Seal everything in</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;">
              <span class="step-tag">Protect</span>
              <svg class="chevron" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><path d="M4 6.5L9 11.5L14 6.5" stroke="#A89070" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="step-expanded">
            <div class="step-expanded-inner">
              <div class="expand-grid">
                <div class="expand-box role">
                  <div class="expand-box-label">What it does</div>
                  <p>Creates a barrier on top of skin that prevents all the moisture and nutrients underneath from evaporating out. Also delivers Niacinamide (reduces redness) and Squalane (softens) throughout the day.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="expand-box why">
                  <div class="expand-box-label">Why fourth</div>
                  <p>Goes on last among the treatment products — heaviest cream goes over lighter serums. Without this, everything from steps 2 and 3 would evaporate off the face within minutes.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="ingredients-row">
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Niacinamide</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Squalane</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Shea Butter</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Argan Oil</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Jojoba Oil</span>
              </div>
              <div class="analogy-bar">
                <span class="analogy-icon">🔒</span>
                <span class="analogy-text">The main door being shut and locked. Everything good stays in, everything damaging stays out.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 5 -->
      <div class="step-item" onclick="toggleStep(this)">
        <div class="step-connector">
          <div class="step-num">5</div>
          <div class="connector-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-card-header">
            <div class="step-card-left">
              <div>
                <div class="step-name">Tonic</div>
                <div class="step-subtitle">Hyaluronic Cooling &amp; Brightening Mist</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;">
              <span class="step-tag">Set</span>
              <svg class="chevron" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><path d="M4 6.5L9 11.5L14 6.5" stroke="#A89070" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="step-expanded">
            <div class="step-expanded-inner">
              <div class="expand-grid">
                <div class="expand-box role">
                  <div class="expand-box-label">What it does</div>
                  <p>A light water-based mist that calms any redness from product application, adds a final surface layer of Hyaluronic Acid, and leaves skin feeling dewy and refreshed — not heavy.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="expand-box why">
                  <div class="expand-box-label">Not the same as Infuse</div>
                  <p>Infuse locks in moisture structurally. Tonic soothes the surface and refreshes. Different jobs — Infuse protects, Tonic comforts. Can also be used midday as a refresh.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="ingredients-row">
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Hyaluronic Acid</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Chamomile</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Aloe Vera</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Green Tea</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Cucumber</span>
              </div>
              <div class="analogy-bar">
                <span class="analogy-icon">🪟</span>
                <span class="analogy-text">Opening a window for air after you've locked the door. The seal is already in place — this is pure comfort and calm.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="summary-bar">
      <span class="summary-icon">☀</span>
      <span class="summary-text">Morning in one line: <strong>Clean → Hydrate → Nourish → Seal → Set.</strong> Each step builds on the last. Skip one and everything after it is less effective.</span>
    </div>

    <div class="pro-tip">
      <span class="pro-tip-label">Pro tip</span>
      <p>After cleansing with Undress, press a warm damp cloth gently to the skin. This opens the pores slightly and boosts how much the serums absorb. Takes 10 seconds — worth it.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- PM PANEL -->
  <div class="routine-panel pm" id="panel-pm">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="time-badge pm">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none">
          <path d="M20 14.5C20 18.09 17.09 21 13.5 21C9.91 21 7 18.09 7 14.5C7 10.91 9.91 8 13.5 8C10.5 8 8 11.13 8 14.5C8 17.87 10.5 21 13.5 21" stroke="#7B9EC8" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <path d="M20 14.5C20 11.13 17.5 8 14.5 8" stroke="#7B9EC8" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <circle cx="20" cy="7" r="1" fill="#7B9EC8"/>
          <circle cx="23" cy="10" r="0.8" fill="#7B9EC8"/>
          <circle cx="22" cy="14" r="0.6" fill="#7B9EC8"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="section-title">
        <h2>Evening Routine</h2>
        <p>5 steps · Clean, hydrate, repair, seal, set</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="steps-flow">

      <!-- PM Step 1 -->
      <div class="step-item" onclick="toggleStep(this)">
        <div class="step-connector">
          <div class="step-num">1</div>
          <div class="connector-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-card-header">
            <div class="step-card-left">
              <div>
                <div class="step-name">Undress</div>
                <div class="step-subtitle">Vitamin E+C Gel Cleanser · More important at night</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;">
              <span class="step-tag">Clean</span>
              <svg class="chevron" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><path d="M4 6.5L9 11.5L14 6.5" stroke="#A89070" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="step-expanded">
            <div class="step-expanded-inner">
              <div class="expand-grid">
                <div class="expand-box role">
                  <div class="expand-box-label">What it does</div>
                  <p>At night, removes the full day — makeup, SPF, pollution particles, and oil buildup. This is actually the most critical cleanse of the day.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="expand-box why">
                  <div class="expand-box-label">Why more important at night</div>
                  <p>Skin does most of its repair work while you sleep. If it's doing that repair through a layer of pollution and old product, the repair is less effective. Clean skin repairs faster.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="ingredients-row">
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Vitamin E</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Vitamin C</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Avocado Oil</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Sunflower Oil</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Papaya Extract</span>
              </div>
              <div class="analogy-bar">
                <span class="analogy-icon">🌙</span>
                <span class="analogy-text">Preparing the building for the overnight repair crew. You wouldn't ask a crew to work in a dirty, cluttered space.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- PM Step 2 -->
      <div class="step-item" onclick="toggleStep(this)">
        <div class="step-connector">
          <div class="step-num">2</div>
          <div class="connector-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-card-header">
            <div class="step-card-left">
              <div>
                <div class="step-name">Drench</div>
                <div class="step-subtitle">Triple Molecular Hyaluronic Serum</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;">
              <span class="step-tag">Hydrate</span>
              <svg class="chevron" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><path d="M4 6.5L9 11.5L14 6.5" stroke="#A89070" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="step-expanded">
            <div class="step-expanded-inner">
              <div class="expand-grid">
                <div class="expand-box role">
                  <div class="expand-box-label">What it does</div>
                  <p>Skin loses moisture while you sleep — even in a warm room. Drench loads hydration back into the skin before you seal everything overnight.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="expand-box why">
                  <div class="expand-box-label">Why again at night</div>
                  <p>The repair work that happens overnight (Transform, Absorb) works best in a hydrated environment. Drench creates that foundation — dry skin repairs slower.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="ingredients-row">
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Glycerin</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Acacia Gum</span>
              </div>
              <div class="analogy-bar">
                <span class="analogy-icon">💧</span>
                <span class="analogy-text">Saturating the soil before planting seeds overnight. Everything that grows (repairs) does so better in moist conditions.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- PM Step 3 -->
      <div class="step-item" onclick="toggleStep(this)">
        <div class="step-connector">
          <div class="step-num">3</div>
          <div class="connector-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-card-header">
            <div class="step-card-left">
              <div>
                <div class="step-name">Transform</div>
                <div class="step-subtitle">BioRetinol &amp; Bakuchiol Serum · PM only</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;">
              <span class="step-tag">Repair</span>
              <svg class="chevron" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><path d="M4 6.5L9 11.5L14 6.5" stroke="#A89070" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="step-expanded">
            <div class="step-expanded-inner">
              <div class="expand-grid">
                <div class="expand-box role">
                  <div class="expand-box-label">What it does</div>
                  <p>Bakuchiol sends biological signals deep into skin cells — telling them to produce more collagen, turn over faster, and repair damage. This reduces fine lines, uneven tone, and dullness over weeks of use.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="expand-box why">
                  <div class="expand-box-label">Why PM only</div>
                  <p>Retinol-type ingredients make skin more sensitive to sunlight. Using it at night also makes sense biologically — skin does most cellular repair while you sleep, so the signals reach cells at exactly the right moment.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="ingredients-row">
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Bakuchiol</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">BioRetinol</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Calendula</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Sweet Almond Oil</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Lavender Oil</span>
              </div>
              <div class="analogy-bar">
                <span class="analogy-icon">🔧</span>
                <span class="analogy-text">Sending the repair crew into the building with specific instructions. They work through the night fixing what the day damaged.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- PM Step 4 -->
      <div class="step-item" onclick="toggleStep(this)">
        <div class="step-connector">
          <div class="step-num">4</div>
          <div class="connector-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-card-header">
            <div class="step-card-left">
              <div>
                <div class="step-name">Absorb</div>
                <div class="step-subtitle">Moisturising Face &amp; Hair Serum · Oil-based overnight seal</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;">
              <span class="step-tag">Seal</span>
              <svg class="chevron" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><path d="M4 6.5L9 11.5L14 6.5" stroke="#A89070" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="step-expanded">
            <div class="step-expanded-inner">
              <div class="expand-grid">
                <div class="expand-box role">
                  <div class="expand-box-label">What it does</div>
                  <p>A rich oil-based jelly that creates a deep overnight seal. It locks in Transform and Drench underneath, and slowly feeds the surface of skin with Argan oil, Vitamins E and C, and two forms of Hyaluronic Acid through the night.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="expand-box why">
                  <div class="expand-box-label">Different from Infuse</div>
                  <p>Infuse is a daytime moisturiser — lightweight, sits under makeup. Absorb is heavier and oil-based — designed for overnight use only. It creates the ideal sealed environment for Transform's repair work to happen.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="ingredients-row">
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Argan Oil</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Jojoba Oil</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Vitamin E</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Vitamin C</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Sodium Hyaluronate</span>
              </div>
              <div class="analogy-bar">
                <span class="analogy-icon">🔒</span>
                <span class="analogy-text">Locking the building overnight so the repair crew (Transform) can work undisturbed. Seals everything in, nothing escapes.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- PM Step 5 -->
      <div class="step-item" onclick="toggleStep(this)">
        <div class="step-connector">
          <div class="step-num">5</div>
          <div class="connector-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-card-header">
            <div class="step-card-left">
              <div>
                <div class="step-name">Tonic</div>
                <div class="step-subtitle">Hyaluronic Cooling &amp; Brightening Mist</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;">
              <span class="step-tag">Set</span>
              <svg class="chevron" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><path d="M4 6.5L9 11.5L14 6.5" stroke="#A89070" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="step-expanded">
            <div class="step-expanded-inner">
              <div class="expand-grid">
                <div class="expand-box role">
                  <div class="expand-box-label">What it does</div>
                  <p>Final mist before sleep. Calms any surface sensitivity from the products, especially Transform which can cause slight warmth in some skin types. Adds a last layer of Hyaluronic Acid and soothing botanicals.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="expand-box why">
                  <div class="expand-box-label">Why at night too</div>
                  <p>Chamomile, Aloe Vera, and Green Tea in Tonic have anti-inflammatory properties. Applying after Transform and Absorb helps calm the skin before sleep and supports the overnight repair environment.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="ingredients-row">
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Hyaluronic Acid</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Chamomile</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Aloe Vera</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Green Tea</span>
                <span class="ingredient-pill">Witch Hazel</span>
              </div>
              <div class="analogy-bar">
                <span class="analogy-icon">✨</span>
                <span class="analogy-text">The final calm before rest. Soothes the surface so everything underneath can repair quietly through the night.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="summary-bar">
      <span class="summary-icon">🌙</span>
      <span class="summary-text">Evening in one line: <strong>Clean → Hydrate → Repair → Seal richly → Set.</strong> Transform does the active work. Absorb makes sure that work happens undisturbed.</span>
    </div>

    <div class="pro-tip">
      <span class="pro-tip-label">Pro tip</span>
      <p>After applying Undress at night, use a warm damp cloth pressed gently to the face before rinsing. This helps remove the day's pollution more thoroughly and prepares skin to absorb Transform more effectively.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-note">
    <p>Every step exists for a reason. Remove one, and the step after it does less.</p>
    <strong>Nyrah Beauty · Made in Ireland</strong>
  </div>

</div>

<script>
  function switchTab(mode) {
    const amPanel = document.getElementById('panel-am');
    const pmPanel = document.getElementById('panel-pm');
    const btns = document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn');

    if (mode === 'am') {
      amPanel.classList.add('active');
      pmPanel.classList.remove('active');
      btns[0].className = 'tab-btn active-am';
      btns[1].className = 'tab-btn';
    } else {
      pmPanel.classList.add('active');
      amPanel.classList.remove('active');
      btns[1].className = 'tab-btn active-pm';
      btns[0].className = 'tab-btn';
    }
  }

  function toggleStep(el) {
    const isOpen = el.classList.contains('open');
    const panel = el.closest('.routine-panel');
    panel.querySelectorAll('.step-item.open').forEach(s => s.classList.remove('open'));
    if (!isOpen) el.classList.add('open');
  }
</script>
</body>
</html>
